# Python testing

Matches **`.cursor/rules/testing.mdc`** concepts (coverage, layers, TDD) using **pytest** idioms.

## Framework

Prefer **pytest** unless the repo standardizes differently.

## Coverage

```bash
pytest --cov=src --cov-report=term-missing
```

Adjust `src`/package roots to match the tree.

## Markers / organization

```python
import pytest

@pytest.mark.unit
def test_calculate_total():
    ...

@pytest.mark.integration
def test_database_connection():
    ...
```

Keep **`code-reviewer`** / CI expectations in mind: deterministic, isolated tests; explicit fixtures for shared setup.